{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 43, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo City of Lights**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nWhere customs wait a formal state.\nThen train to Shinjuku a bustling place\nA modern marvel full of grace.\nA hotel awaits a haven sweet\nTo rest thy weary travel feet.\nIn evening's hush a ramen feast\nA culinary delight at least.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa we shall then proceed\nWhere Sensoji Temple doth indeed\nStand proud and tall a sight to see\nWith ancient history for thee.\nThen Ueno Park a verdant scene\nWith museums grand and gardens keen.\nExplore the stalls of Nakamise-dori\nFor trinkets charms and stories free.\nTokyo Skytree a towering spire\nTo gaze upon the city's fire.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountain Majesty**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's grace\nWhere mountains rise in time and space.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi serene\nWith views of Fuji's peaks unseen.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum's art\nA wondrous sight to touch the heart.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease thy spirit keep it calm.\nReturn to Tokyo as day descends\nWhere evening's magic transcends.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nBy bullet train we swiftly fly\nTo Kyoto's realm beneath the sky.\nA city ancient steeped in lore\nWhere temples stand forevermore.\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA thousand pathways overhead.\nKiyomizu-dera a wooden stage\nTo witness beauty age by age.\nGion district a geisha's keep\nWhere secrets slumber soft and deep.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling gleam\nReflecting light a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's rocks a Zen display\nTo ponder life in a quiet way.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove so tall\nA verdant whisper answering all.\nTenryu-ji Temple's garden bright\nA peaceful haven pure delight.\nA traditional tea ceremony's art\nTo calm the mind and soothe the heart.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nTo Nara we journey close at hand\nWhere friendly deer roam through the land.\nTodai-ji Temple holds a giant Buddha\nA sight of awe a sacred huddle.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns glow\nA path of light where spirits flow.\nExplore the park with playful grace\nA joyful smile on every face.\nReturn to Kyoto ere nightfall's keep.\n\n**Day Seventh Departure Farewell**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid adieu\nTo Japan's wonders fresh and new.\nFrom Kansai Airport we shall depart\nWith memories etched within the heart.\nA land of beauty grace and might\nA journey cherished pure and bright.\nFarewell Japan until we meet\nAgain thy magic bittersweet.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.4760569930076599}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9031413197517395}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.001304133329540491}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.08227350562810898}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.22551290690898895}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.041724029928445816}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.037102241069078445}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.09817243367433548}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.04512789472937584}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.22245991230010986}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.1682923585176468}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.006173825357109308}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.657332181930542}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.6531673669815063}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.006126197054982185}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.00378855736926198}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0877935141324997}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0020295039284974337}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -7.98